# REST API

## Get All Profiles
## curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

## Create New Profiles
### curl -X http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
     "username": "demo",
     "password": "1234",
     "mobile": "1234567890",
     "cardId": "1234567890000"
}
